Open audit item selected for this continuation: pinned Java `MQClientAPIImpl.listUser` uses `RemotingSerializable.decodeList`; Fastjson 2.0.63 returns a one-element list containing the original object-root text for `{}`. Rust currently reports `MalformedResponse`. The existing Java fixture and core integration test capture this mismatch. Plan: preserve this raw list value through the Rust `UserInfo` serialization adapter, update the existing end-to-end differential, and rerun affected protocol/core tests and broader gates.

